"q_en": "A single carbohydrate binding domain of a lectin often binds its oligosaccharide with only micromolar to millimolar Kd — weak by the standards of protein-ligand interactions. Why is that weakness appropriate rather than a defect, given how selectins work?",
"q_cn": "凝集素的单个糖结合结构域与其寡糖结合时，Kd 常常只有微摩尔到毫摩尔量级——按蛋白-配体相互作用的标准来说很弱。考虑到选择素的工作方式，为什么这种「弱」是恰当的，而不是一种缺陷？",
