"q_en": "Czech node 8-2-3-2 draws the phospholipid backbone and names the head groups, but never says why glycerol needs its own numbering convention. Supply the missing argument, and say what an sn number means.",
"q_cn": "捷克节点 `8-2-3-2` 画了磷脂骨架、点名了各个头基，却从未说明甘油为什么需要一套自己的编号约定。请把缺掉的这段论证补上，并说明一个 sn 编号究竟是什么意思。",
