"why_en": "Chapter 10 defers the pathway twice — “ The sterols of all eukaryotes are synthesized from simple five-carbon isoprene subunits ” (A p.352), and again on A p.360 — so it cannot arbitrate. Chapter 21 does, in two places. The running text of section 21.4 gives geranyl pyrophosphate from IPP plus DMAPP, then “ Geranyl pyrophosphate undergoes another head-to-tail condensation with isopentenyl pyrophosphate, yielding the 15-carbon intermediate farnesyl pyrophosphate ” , then two farnesyl pyrophosphate head to head to squalene (A p.774). And the printed pathway in chapter 21's Data Analysis Problem sets out the whole series with carbon counts: geranyl pyrophosphate C10, farnesyl pyrophosphate C15, geranylgeranyl pyrophosphate C20, phytoene C40, each of the first three steps adding one IPP and the last joining two geranylgeranyl pyrophosphates (A p.792). So GGPP is FPP plus IPP, exactly as node 8-3-8's arithmetic predicted. The Czech book's own p.183, recorded in node 8-2-4-1, already has it right under the name digeranyl-PP; only p.192's figure disagrees.",
"why_cn": "**第 10 章两次把通路推走**——**「所有真核生物的固醇，都由简单的五碳异戊二烯亚单元合成」**（A 第 352 页），**A 第 360 页又推了一次**——**所以它裁定不了**。**第 21 章能裁定，而且在两处。** **21.4 节的正文给出：IPP 加 DMAPP 生成 geranyl pyrophosphate**；接着**「Geranyl pyrophosphate 再与 isopentenyl pyrophosphate 进行一次头尾缩合，产生十五碳的中间物 farnesyl pyrophosphate」**；随后**两个 farnesyl pyrophosphate 头对头生成 squalene**（A 第 774 页）。**而第 21 章 Data Analysis Problem 里印出的通路，把整条序列连同碳数一起摆了出来**：**geranyl pyrophosphate C10、farnesyl pyrophosphate C15、geranylgeranyl pyrophosphate C20、phytoene C40**——**前三步每一步加一个 IPP，最后一步把两个 geranylgeranyl pyrophosphate 连起来**（A 第 792 页）。**所以 GGPP 就是 FPP + IPP，与节点 `8-3-8` 的算术所预言的完全一致。** **捷克教材自己的 p.183（记录在节点 `8-2-4-1` 里）已经用 digeranyl-PP 这个名字把它写对了**；**只有 p.192 那张图不一致。**"
