"why_en": "The section defines the term through the observation: each inhibitor alone produces only partial inhibition, but the effects of multiple inhibitors are more than additive, and all eight together virtually shut down the enzyme — this is an example of cumulative feedback inhibition, giving a constant adjustment of glutamine levels to match metabolic requirements. The design logic is that no single downstream product can close a shared entry point by itself. Superimposed on the allosteric regulation is inhibition by adenylylation, the addition of AMP to Tyr397 near the active site, which increases sensitivity to the allosteric inhibitors, with activity falling as more subunits are adenylylated. That modification is controlled by adenylyltransferase acting with the regulatory protein PII, which is itself uridylylated or deuridylylated by a single uridylyltransferase responding to glutamine, Pi, alpha-ketoglutarate and ATP — and uridylylated PII additionally activates transcription of the synthetase gene. Options 2, 3 and 4 invent competitive binding, an obligatory sequence, and an irreversible accumulation respectively, none of which the section describes.",
"why_cn": "**本节正是通过那个观察来定义这个术语的**：**每一种抑制剂单独只产生部分抑制，但多种抑制剂的效应超过简单相加，八者同时存在时几乎把该酶完全关停**——**这就是累积反馈抑制的一个例子，它使谷氨酰胺水平能持续地按代谢需求作出调整**。**其设计逻辑是：任何单一的下游产物都无法独自关掉一个共享的入口**。**叠加在别构调节之上的，是由腺苷酰化造成的抑制**——**把 AMP 加到活性位点附近的 Tyr397 上**，**它提高该酶对别构抑制剂的敏感性，且被腺苷酰化的亚基越多，活性越低**。**这一修饰由 adenylyltransferase 与调节蛋白 PII 共同控制**；**而 PII 自身的尿苷酰化与去尿苷酰化由同一个 uridylyltransferase 完成，后者响应谷氨酰胺、Pi、α-酮戊二酸与 ATP**——**并且尿苷酰化的 PII 还会激活该合成酶基因的转录**。**选项 2、3、4** 分别凭空发明了竞争性结合、强制的先后顺序，以及不可逆的累积，本节都没有描述过。"
