"why_en": "Two facts have to be held together here, and the resolution is the central idea of evo-devo. First the conservation: Hox clusters have been part of the developmental program of multicellular eukaryotes for over 500 million years, Drosophila has one cluster and humans have four, and the genes within them are remarkably similar from nematodes to humans -- with mouse HOXA7 and fly antennapedia differing by a single residue. Second the divergence: although the molecular regulatory mechanisms are similar, many ultimate developmental events are not conserved, because the outcomes are brought about by differences in the downstream target genes that the Hox genes control. The regulator is the same; what it regulates is not. Box 28-1 sharpens this into a measured result. Among Galapagos finches, Clifford Tabin's group found that expression level of a single gene, Bmp4, correlated with the robust beaks of ground finches, and confirmed causation by artificially expressing high Bmp4 in chicken embryos, which produced more robust beaks; long slender beaks were separately linked to calmodulin expression at particular developmental stages. So major changes in beak shape and function came from subtle changes in the expression of just two developmental regulators -- very few mutations were needed, the mutations affect **regulation**, and no new genes were required. The most striking conservation result makes the same point from the other direction: eye development is triggered by Pax6 in both flies and mammals, and the fly Pax6 gene will trigger mouse eye development in a mouse.",
"why_cn": "这里要同时握住**两个事实**，而它们的调和正是 **evo-devo** 的核心思想。**第一是保守性**：Hox 基因簇已经是多细胞真核生物发育程序的一部分**超过五亿年**，果蝇有**一个**簇、人有**四个**，簇内基因**从线虫到人惊人地相似**——小鼠 HOXA7 与果蝇 antennapedia **只差一个残基**。**第二是分歧**：尽管**分子调控机制相似**，许多**最终的发育事件并不保守**，因为**这些结果是由 Hox 基因所控制的「下游靶基因」的差别造成的**。**调控者是同一个；它调控的东西不是。** 框 28-1 把这一点锐化成一个**被测量出来的结果**。在加拉帕戈斯雀中，Clifford Tabin 的研究组发现**单一基因 Bmp4** 的表达水平与**地雀**粗壮的喙相关，并通过**在鸡胚中人为高表达 Bmp4**（结果确实产生更粗壮的喙）**确认了因果**；而**细长的喙**则另被关联到**特定发育阶段的钙调蛋白**表达。**所以喙的形状与功能上的重大改变，来自仅仅两个发育调控基因表达上的细微变化——需要的突变极少，这些突变影响的是「调控」，而且不需要任何新基因。** 保守性方面最惊人的结果从另一个方向说明同一件事：**眼的发育在果蝇和哺乳动物中都由 Pax6 触发，而果蝇的 Pax6 基因能在小鼠体内触发小鼠眼睛的发育。**"
